    "title": "NEB SOC: Soccer releases 2026 Schedule - NewsBreak",
    "text": "9 hours ago The Nebraska soccer team will play 19 matches, including 10 home and nine away, next season, as the team announced its 2026 schedule on Wednesday. Nebraska will kick off the 2026 campaign on Wednesday, Aug. 5 against Colorado State in Fort Collins, Colo., before heading to Louisville, Ky., to take on Louisville on Wednesday, Aug. 12. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
